  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-jipu",
      "text": "Jipu (计谱) manuscript crew for DeepSeek Harness — a reader-first, gate-driven pipeline for long-form fiction, packaged as a DSH host plugin."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it gives you",
      "text": "A single `jipu` tool with four actions:\n\n| action | does |\n|---|---|\n| `skill` | read the manuscript manual (`SKILL.md`) and its 12 references, paginated with `offset` / `limit` |\n| `scripts` | list the 14 gate scripts |\n| `run` | run a gate script inside a project root (requires `project`) |\n| `selftest` | run a script's built-in `--selftest` |"
    },
    {
      "section": "What it gives you",
      "text": "The 14 scripts cover: project scaffold, option-card check, capability self-test, recall pack, sentence check, object inventory, dialogue attribution, image/filter check, chapter metrics, number ledger, chapter physical, chapter gate, reader verdict, ledger check."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it gives you",
      "text": "The skill ships the full manuscript workflow: outline-first chapter construction, eight-beat outline, three hard gates, T0/T1/T2 delivery tiers, three revision loops, plus 12 genre template libraries, 81 beat templates and a trope library."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-jipu\n```\n\nOr add it as a bundle in a profile's `dsh.profile.bundles`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "```\njipu { action: \"scripts\" }\njipu { action: \"skill\", path: \"SKILL.md\", offset: 1, limit: 80 }\njipu { action: \"run\", project: \"D:/books/my-book\", script: \"章体检\", args: [\"3\"] }\njipu { action: \"selftest\", script: \"句检\" }\n\nGate scripts are copied into a project's `08_工具_脚本/` by the project scaffold; the copies inside this package are for self-test and for opening a new project. Judge a manuscript with the project's own copy, not this one."
    },
    {
      "section": "Layout",
      "text": "```\nindex.js            host plugin, registers the jipu tool\ncordis.patch.yml    loader patch\nskill/              SKILL.md, references/, assets/, tools/, agents/\nlocale/             en + zh display metadata"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
